        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA SENJATA 1960 Pindaan seksyen 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_47",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "47",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Senjata 1960, yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Bahagian ini, dipinda dalam subseksyen 2(1) dengan memotong takrif “imprisonment for life”. Pindaan seksyen 14"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "48",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 14 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1) Any person who manufactures an arm or ammunition without a valid licence granted under section 12 or in contravention of any condition imposed under paragraph 12(2)(a) shall, on conviction— (a) be punished with imprisonment for a term of not less than thirty years but not exceeding forty years and with whipping of not less than six strokes; and (b) in the case of a company, firm, society or body of persons, be punished with a fine not exceeding five million ringgit.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “twenty-five thousand ringgit” dengan perkataan “two hundred and fifty thousand ringgit”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_IV__cl_48__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
