      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA KANUN TATACARA JENAYAH Pindaan seksyen 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_61",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "61",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Kanun Tatacara Jenayah, yang disebut “Kanun” dalam Bahagian ini, dipinda dalam subseksyen 15(3) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “punishable with death” perkataan “or with imprisonment for a term of not less than thirty years but not exceeding forty years”. Pindaan seksyen 172d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_62",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "62",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subperenggan 172 d(3)(b)(ii) Kanun dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “imprisonment for natural life” dengan perkataan “imprisonment for a term of not less than thirty years but not exceeding forty years”. Pindaan seksyen 388"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_63",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "63",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 388(1) Kanun dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “imprisonment for life” perkataan “or imprisonment for a term which may extend to forty years”. Pindaan seksyen 425a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_64",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "64",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/7/msa@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 425a(2) Kanun dipinda dengan menggantikan perenggan (c) dengan perenggan yang berikut: “(c) imprisonment for a term of not less than thirty years but not exceeding forty years.”. Pindaan Jadual Pertama"
      }
    },
